  "description": "A drop-in replacement for HttpClient that adds common resiliency patterns such as circuit breaker, retry, and timeout. Compatible with .NET Standard 2.1 and Unity projects. Features: Circuit Breaker Pattern, Automatic Retry Logic, Timeout Handling, Per-Request Policies, Content Cloning for Retries, No External Dependencies, Well-Tested (96.7% coverage with 112 tests).",
