  "releaseNotes": "v1.0.0: Production-ready release\n- Fixed critical content cloning bug for POST/PUT retries\n- 96.7% code coverage with 112 comprehensive tests\n- Extensive documentation with best practices and architecture decisions\n- Thread-safe implementation suitable for concurrent use\n- Per-request policy customization support\n- Optional DI extension package available for ASP.NET Core",
